{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_029_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cfb3cd6b60f1e1050d6b7a838c0e20903b9f55b98f7f0aae2a382df44b30afbe",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8e76759f07760b92345f09c519f0abf69008c4c90ea48ff0d8ed3798613c7d5",
      "text": "这、这难道是……\n缠绕着漆黑之暗的黑之宝玉……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa4a30ecf6375a3a341fd97aa64f4e273a1ce2b702f30b49e888a890314eb663",
      "text": "原来如此，今日乃战乙女们的决战之日。\n但未曾料想竟能从吾主处蒙赐黑之宝玉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d6b6ebaa9078f97186358f542b744c2f9163ab1c8603b74fdaca1d18514dbe1",
      "text": "而且，不仅是我，竟然连撒旦都有一份！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b46dc4aacea3a55906be4746fddeeb344af5521c3361eb08ab4c0d2bbdf55654",
      "text": "这番心意，深表感激，吾主。\n我立誓必将报答此等供物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1895f5b2f2547420a2da8e25713019fc34ea34ec20dfcc5cd7e95dffa4dd524",
      "text": "暂且，便让此恩于白之圣战中得报吧！\n库库库……吾主，就静候那一天的降临吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b38ca53cb4d8c4fe053dd58c401242a3715a541cd0f7c205246cd4c380852f7",
      "text": "此乃……缠绕着漆黑之暗的黑之宝玉！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0711588651087204be565e986684935d94fa4ac034cd8e0865e705fe8838d5",
      "text": "你是说，特地为我准备了此物吗。\n汝之这番心意，我从心底深表感激！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f794a99f17625c2df52097cf870fb6f8c1a442a6e70ed59eee124d0ac2fde778",
      "text": "……话说回来，从这宝玉中飘散而出的，\n乃是何等浓密甘美的芳香！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a9613404f17f3916a05dd490461366cf276619ebc811888fd9b05fa364565f",
      "text": "甚至能让我亲身体会到其中满溢而出的\n暗之力量。当真妙极！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000034:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c17127fdb831eba4a521f2b1d9c76dc664f45e5560decf50cf425f4aab16f4b2",
      "text": "您能喜欢真是太好了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000035:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a10ed3bc5b566848800d78a9d16c3505f284b2a8af87f923dd829908c41c9f6",
      "text": "我试尝过，非常美味呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60d709d2330efd5864e082de9716410a8b35da842df536e3325fe1637db5f363",
      "text": "嗯。所言极是。正好，因锻炼使得魔力\n处于枯竭之际。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60d709d2330efd5864e082de9716410a8b35da842df536e3325fe1637db5f363",
      "text": "嗯。所言极是。正好，因锻炼使得魔力\n处于枯竭之际。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebd6cf5e4869ded0618d11653b86bdb13018c95f58bab70f2f1089d2b1409243",
      "text": "且容我享用一颗吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f39a6e723534c25d60bb28f889410432446b15648ed6d1e933b9e5d4007f22d5",
      "text": "何、何等的美味……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d50a7221a36a94910bf8a6018bc3e97be22e89a64e9e24382e75565fc221062",
      "text": "喔喔……！何等绝妙！\n我能感受到暗之魔力正充盈于身……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_029_22:5_01_029_22_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dadb1d3b64757463dac5f60598d4ea5f2dd54027b07f3cd9d1eddf4ac860f76c",
      "text": "吾主，此番的心意，我必定于白之圣战中\n予以回应！哈——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
